  "abstract": "Same SAP rank-selection as Pmax=48 but with larger projection capacity Pmax=56 and slightly stronger gate L1 (\u03bb_g=1.5e-5). Tests whether the learned effective rank stabilizes near p\u224836 without manual tuning.",
